 runtime uses Google Cloud, with BigQuery as the governed analytical source of truth. The portal is deployed on Render." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#111827;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1010" width="1000" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>